      "writtenOn": "2021-03-13T18:45:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this reference to function board_i2c_p2c? Chip HW allows any I2C controller to use any port. Chip level code has no knowledge of port to controller assignments. Chip level calls board_i2c_p2c to get the controller the requested port is mapped to for the specific board.",
