        "id": 1296157
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-15T18:42:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "as any port can be assigned to any controller why not default assign them in the mchp chip code?\nif specific board wants in certain order then the override function can be used.\nex: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/refs/heads/main/include/common.h#172",
      "parentUuid": "848a3a3a_dbd0c9a4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 183,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 210,
