        "id": 1296157
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-24T21:20:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this is how  I would do in chp/i2.c\nwe know the number of I2C ports used from i2c_ports_used \u0026 port you can get from i2c_ports[i].port.\n\nat init allocate the each controller to i2c port.\nMay be assign serially or any best method available.\n\nwhen the i2c_port_to_controller() is called take that previously assigned value and return.\n\nif board want to override this default config for any reason allow it by declaring function as overridable",
      "parentUuid": "eeeee9ee_6eabf76e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 183,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 210,
        "endChar": 0
